---
metadata:
  layer: templates
  scope: templates/
  version: "1.0"
  description: Starter files emitted by norm init

template:
  required_directories: [profiles/]
  single_source_of_truth:
    - source: profiles/
      for: profile starter .norm files

agent_rules:
  update_order:
    - "Update the corresponding profile schema"
    - "Update the template"
    - "Update init contract fixtures"
  reference_policy:
    target_must_exist: true
    allow_external: false
    require_description: true

strong_references:
  - type: source
    target: /schema/profiles/
    sync: auto_pull
    validation: strict
    description: Profile schemas define template recommendations
  - type: downstream
    target: /crates/norm-cli/
    sync: auto_push
    validation: loose
    description: The CLI will expose templates through norm init
---

# Template conventions

Keep one starter per supported profile and validate every starter strictly.
